    "step3Desc": "GlobalGAP, organic, ISO and production capacity are verified. Credential schemas are open so external certifiers can sign directly later.",
    "step4Title": "Buyers Search & Self-verify",
    "step4Desc": "Sourcing companies filter by product, certification, season and verification tier; check credential signatures and document hashes on-chain, then contact suppliers directly."
